---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { AUTHOR_NAME, CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED, REVIEW_CYCLE_MONTHS } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Contact Mon Titre de Séjour: report a changed fee or official page" description="Write to us if an official page has changed, a stamp duty or threshold is out of date, or a calculator gets something wrong. We do not handle individual applications." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Contact' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>One address, read by the publisher: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.</p>
    <h2>What helps us</h2>
    <p>A link to the official source that contradicts a figure: the updated Service-Public.fr page, the order published in the Official Journal, or the article of the immigration code (CESEDA) or Civil Code. For a calculation, copy the address your browser shows after you enter values: it holds the inputs, never your name. Every confirmed error is fixed and becomes an automated test, as the <a href={route('editorial', lang)}>editorial policy</a> sets out.</p>
    <h2>What we do not do</h2>
    <p>We do not review files, book prefecture appointments or answer questions about a personal situation: we are neither a government office nor a law firm. For your own file, contact your prefecture, OFII, a migrant-support association or a free legal-access point.</p>
    <h2>Embedding a calculator</h2><p>Associations, universities, HR teams and newsrooms may embed the "which permit for my situation" calculator free of charge: the code is on the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>.</p>
    <h2>Response time</h2><p>Usually within five working days; fee changes come first. Every amount is reviewed at least every {REVIEW_CYCLE_MONTHS} months and after each reform.</p>
    <h2>Publisher</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang={lang} />
    <p>See the <a href={route('terms', lang)}>legal notice</a>. Responsible: {AUTHOR_NAME}. Updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
